{"4756740":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Dinofurie | The Dinosaur's Battle Royale","steam_appid":4756740,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the brutal world of <strong>Dinofurie<\/strong>, a fast-paced online dinosaur battle royale where only the strongest survive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against other players as powerful prehistoric creatures in massive multiplayer battles filled with ambushes, bleeding wounds, venom, grapples, and raw force. Master unique dinosaur abilities, dominate the food chain, and become the last survivor on the island of <strong>LaBBany<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dangerous environments ranging from swamps and forests to giant canyons and coastal cliffs while the deadly storm closes in, forcing players into intense close-range combat.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dinosaur offers a completely different playstyle:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge into battle as a horned herbivore<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bleed enemies dry with giant predators<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ambush prey from the water<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pin, grapple, stun, or overpower opponents using skill-based combat mechanics<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory depends on timing, positioning, stamina management, and mastering your dinosaur’s strengths.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Multiplayer Dinosaur Battle Royale<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill-Based Combat System<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bleeding, Venom, Stuns, Grapples &amp; Knockbacks<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Dinosaur Abilities and Matchups<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large Playable Dinosaurs<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dyna